# Frontend environment (copy to frontend/.env; never commit .env).
# Origin that the Vite dev/preview server proxies /v1 and /healthz to. The browser only ever talks to the
# Vite origin, so the refresh cookie stays same-origin and SameSite=Strict.
# Use the API origin of your running backend, for example the one printed by `ragassist` or compose.
API_PROXY_TARGET=
# Playwright (mocked specs): origin the preview server listens on. Left empty, Playwright picks a free
# port for you through the PLAYWRIGHT_WEB_PORT variable; set it only if you need a fixed one.
PLAYWRIGHT_WEB_PORT=
